# Example remote-state settings

Copy `backend.hcl.example` to `backend.hcl` and pass it to Terraform:

```bash
terraform -chdir=infra init -backend-config=backend.hcl
```

`backend.hcl` is gitignored. State locking uses S3 lock files (`use_lockfile`), which needs Terraform 1.10 or newer. See `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`.
